<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>{{ subject }}</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f6f9fc;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,sans-serif;line-height:1.6;color:#1a1a2e">
  <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;padding:40px 20px">
    <tr>
      <td style="background:#ffffff;border-radius:12px;padding:40px 32px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.05)">
        <p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;color:#1a1a2e">
          Hi {{ first_name|default("there") },
        </p>

        <p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;color:#374151">
          Following up on my last note — I know inboxes get crazy.
        </p>

        <p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;color:#374151">
          Thought you might find this useful: we just published a <a href="{{ resource_link|default('https://coldemailos.dev/guide') }}" style="color:#2563eb">technical guide</a> on how 50+ engineering teams reduced false-positive rejections by 84% using calibrated assessments.
        </p>

        <p style="margin:0 0 24px;font-size:16px;color:#374151">
          No strings attached — just thought it might help with the hiring push.
        </p>

        <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:24px 0">
          <tr>
            <td align="center">
              <a href="{{ resource_link|default('https://coldemailos.dev/guide') }}" style="display:inline-block;background:#059669;color:#ffffff;font-weight:600;font-size:15px;padding:14px 28px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none">
                Read the guide
              </a>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>

        <hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #eef2f7;margin:32px 0">

        <p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:13px;color:#9ca3af">
          Best,<br>
          <strong>{{ sender_name|default("The ColdEmailOS Team") }}</strong>
        </p>

        <p style="margin:16px 0 0;font-size:12px;color:#9ca3af">
          <a href="{{ unsubscribe_url|default('#') }}" style="color:#9ca3af">Unsubscribe</a> •
          <a href="{{ preferences_url|default('#') }}" style="color:#9ca3af">Preferences</a>
        </p>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</body>
</html>